{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788373676194,"sessionID":"ses_f9ca2427bffeVwNvwc6e496rx3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-86420b4a256c42b7","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"Backend::Go|Backend::Js","include":"*.rs"},"output":"Found 14 matches\n/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-float-build-go/src/lib.rs:\n  Line 47:         Backend::Js,\n\n  Line 50:         Backend::Go,\n\n  Line 63:             Backend::Js => \"js\",\n\n  Line 66:             Backend::Go => \"go\",\n\n  Line 75:             Backend::Js => Ok(emit_js::emit(program)),\n\n  Line 78:             Backend::Go => Ok(emit_go::emit(program)),\n\n  Line 230:         Backend::Js => run_node(&emit_js::emit(&program), &feed),\n\n  Line 240:         Backend::Go => run_go(&emit_go::emit(&program), &feed),\n\n\n/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-float-build-go/tests/backend_js.rs:\n  Line 42:     let out = toylang::run_on(\"1.5 + 0.25 * 2.0\\n\", None, Backend::Js).unwrap();\n\n  Line 50:     let out = toylang::run_on(\"1.0 / 0.0\\n\", None, Backend::Js).unwrap();\n\n  Line 57:     let nan = toylang::run_on(\"0.0 / 0.0\\n\", None, Backend::Js).unwrap();\n\n  Line 59:     let neg = toylang::run_on(\"-1.0 / 0.0\\n\", None, Backend::Js).unwrap();\n\n  Line 66:     let out = toylang::run_on(\"1.5 < 2.5\\n\", None, Backend::Js).unwrap();\n\n  Line 75:     let out = toylang::run_on(src, Some(\"2.5\"), Backend::Js).unwrap();\n","metadata":{"matches":14,"truncated":false},"title":"Backend::Go|Backend::Js","time":{"start":1788373676165,"end":1788373676192}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now let me look at how the Go backend is run in tests — the harness that actually runs Go code. Let me find where `Backend::Go` is executed (probably in a shared test helper that shells out to `go run`).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_06360ad1c001EO5H86L4HYwseV","sessionID":"ses_f9ca2427bffeVwNvwc6e496rx3","messageID":"msg_06360a429001V2f00bUYVOtmtL"}}
